# Ignore everything
/*

# Except these files & folders
!/src
!/public
!/.github
!tsconfig.json
!astro.config.ts
!package.json
!.prettierrc
!eslint.config.js
!README.md
!.vscode

# Ignore MDX files
*.mdx

# Never reformat post prose. These files are written in Typora, which emits
# trailing spaces and `*italic*`; Prettier rewrites both. The result renders
# identically, but it churns published prose and — because Typora reintroduces
# it on every edit — would turn format:check red again with each new post,
# breaking the CI gate that release.yml relies on to publish.
/src/content/posts/**/*.md

# Generated lockfile. The /.github whitelist above would otherwise pull it in,
# and there is nothing to gain from hand-formatting a file pnpm rewrites.
/.github/scripts/pnpm-lock.yaml